# Controlled cannon fixture near the second DK coin.
# Player/map/camera setup only; actual cannon sets speed and duration.
# Release directional input during the flight and keep B for the high arc.
# Bounded entrance survey: disposable uncleared save; map coordinate shortcut.
# Clean-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No imported savestates; map/player shortcuts are explicit below.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180

